{"title":"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/1/b41bba8ab08e927a6d31f391126fa79b8a0fcc18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{10^{2} + 2 \\times 10 \\times 11 + 11^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"203\" height=\"21\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/8/c38824c53a53090a3bc4d32e5e3dd8195fa8184d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{10^{2} + 2 \\times 10 \\times 11 + 11^{2}} = \\sqrt{100 + 220 + 121}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"368\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/b/edbb3324efda2fe047467e2a2dcc46425ebd4b85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sqrt{441}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"63\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/e/30ead80696cda7fed3a554766d55620fe5dc85a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"50\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realise <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/9/869ab6ac6c019d7af0c51c1ea0f4ed9c1360404a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + y)^{2} = x^{2} + 2xy + y^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"198\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/f/51f6a5a22cb99e47e3f8aa1c3cd2ef1abcb16fed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{2} + 2 \\times 10 \\times 11 + 11^{2} = (10 + 11)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"292\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/0058b4ab2a71d49b7aa8aa13dcb882dcbc61d4b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" />. This would mean the square root would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/3866dbf1d954e409beb13f52f7ed7618bedc183f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"31\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC\" title=\"2024 CSMC\">2024 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018065714\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 89/1000000\nPost‐e